  introduction: "N\u0103m 184, kh\u1EDFi ngh\u0129a Kh\u0103n V\xE0ng lan r\u1ED9ng.\nQu\xE2n tri\u1EC1u \u0111\xECnh v\xE0 c\xE1c ngh\u0129a binh c\xF9ng nhau d\u1EB9p lo\u1EA1n,\ngi\u1EA3i c\u1EE9u d\xE2n ch\xFAng, ng\u0103n ch\u1EB7n \xE2m m\u01B0u c\u1EE7a Tr\u01B0\u01A1ng Gi\xE1c."
